content:
Generate a vertical printed poster around specific theme content. First, translate the theme into an enlarged tactile main specimen or mass of matter, placed in the center or lower-middle of the frame, giving it clear recognizable edges, soft volume, local high-density details, and touchable material changes. The subject is not displayed in isolation but is sandwiched by a giant title, edge text, hard-edged checkerboard modules, and low-contrast explanatory text. The title uses a heavy font with a clear skeleton, becoming an edge structure at the top, bottom, or side, participating in the composition like a wall, base, or sidebar; text forms the structure before carrying semantics. Let the subject's outline, attached fragments, material edges, or symbolic shards partially overlap titles, vertical text, and geometric blocks, forming a clear but restrained foreground-background layer, so that imagery and layout interweave rather than avoid each other. The background is a single warm, low-noise, printable paper field with fine grain, fibers, particles, and a slight ink-absorption feel, used to unify the realistic subject, flat text, and geometric blocks. The background maintains a sense of breathing and medium, without creating real space. Colors are layered by responsibility: the paper base takes up the largest area; the subject retains the most delicate emotional colors, soft gradients, and local saturation; titles, edge characters, or checkerboards use flatter, more stable structural colors; body text and annotations recede into the paper with low contrast. The overall balance features clear area differences, brightness order, and a sweetness suppressed by the structure. Place one or two hard-edged checkerboard modules in corners as planar rhythm anchors; they have no perspective or shadow, printed directly on the paper to balance the subject's curves, title volume, and white space pressure. Small body text should not look like independent labels but be compressed into compact informational textures embedded in the gaps around the subject, maintaining short line spacing, restrained colors, and an editorial feel. Details of the subject are concentrated only in positions that best convey tactile sensation and theme identity, while other secondary edges are allowed to be cropped, blocked, or slightly softened to maintain hierarchy. The final surface has a vintage print passivation, with slightly soft text edges, ink deposition in color blocks, and paper texture running through all layers without blurring subject details, overall presenting a hybrid of a carefully typographed editorial poster, packaging layout, and specimen description.

Theme: {argument name="poster theme" default="Apple promotion poster"}
Ratio: {argument name="aspect ratio" default="9:10"}

Create a visual work with portfolio cover order centered on specific thematic content. The core object should not be displayed in full, but first compressed into a main mass deviating from the central axis, sinking between a translucent atomized surface layer and a low-saturation background field. The full outline, secondary details, and ordinary descriptions of the object are swallowed by embossed glass particles, tiny refractive displacements, milky atomization, and low-contrast blur, leaving only a clean and clear narrow window cut at the position that best carries thematic identification. This part retains realistic texture, high contrast, and necessary colors, while the rest turns into dark masses, softened outlines, broken edges, and transitions consumed by the background. The clear narrow window should be like a precise gap wiped from the material surface, restrained in size but accurate in semantics, becoming the only strong entrance for viewers. The background is derived from the thematic spatial relationships, material attributes, time direction, and emotional temperature into a large-area low-noise color field, with a light airy feel at the top or outer side and a light-colored breathing zone on one side. The area where the main body is located is pressed into lower brightness. The background does not assume ordinary scene narrative but carries the functions of swallowing edges, carrying white text, and creating distance and memory. Color maintains a proportion between large-area low-saturation structural colors, low-brightness main colors, small amounts of concentrated realistic colors, and white information colors; hues change with the theme, while brightness levels, saturation restraint, and local color value remain stable. The picture uses three layers: clear, semi-clear, and out-of-focus. The clear narrow window is responsible for theme identification, short bold white titles and numbers remain semi-clearly readable, and most of the main body, background, and micro-information at the bottom enter atomized out-of-focus. The text uses modern sans-serif fonts, white or near-white, with short, heavy, bold titles that look like they are printed on the glass and slightly bitten by the surface layer. Corner identifiers, edge dates, numbers, and micro-annotations at the bottom form a metadata coordinate system like work numbers, archive records, and production parameters, serving the reading path without covering the clear narrow window. The entire surface retains visible tactile embossed glass texture, with texture density changing with the brightness of the underlying layer—denser in dark parts, milkier in bright parts, with fine refraction and slight displacement at the edges. All images, objects, and text look unified under the same material. The final image should present a calm, restrained visual cover with a technical archival feel: information is intentionally hidden, and only the most critical parts are released.

Theme: {argument name="theme" default="Crazy Thursday KFC"} 
Ratio: 9:10

Subject: {argument name="subject" default="A cool Japanese-style portrait at a summer cafe terrace"}
People/Expression: {argument name="character and expression" default="Young woman with black hair, loosely curled long hair, natural makeup, translucent skin, soft smile, natural eye contact, elegant and friendly atmosphere"}
Clothing/Pose: {argument name="clothing and pose" default="Fluffy white blouse, modest V-neck, light blue mini skirt, white strap sandals, delicate necklace, small white bag, natural posture showing off legs while sitting on a cafe chair, holding a spoon with one hand and enjoying peach shaved ice"}
Background/Light: Open-air cafe terrace on a Japanese street corner, glass windows, blackboard menu, potted greens, small round table, peach shaved ice and iced latte, soft summer sunlight, refreshing afternoon with a pleasant breeze
Composition/Camera: Vertical composition, near full-body portrait, subject placed slightly to the right, natural perspective, shallow depth of field, soft background blur, SNS-worthy lifestyle photo, composition surrounded by white hand-drawn lines around person and objects, scattered with handwritten notes
Texture/Style: High definition, 4K quality, natural skin texture visible down to pores and texture, smooth and natural skin texture, delicate hair details, bright and soft tones, magazine photo-like finish, translucent Japanese-style portrait, summery lightness, cafe snap-style expression with white hand-drawn characters, arrows, hearts, and sparkles added
Negative: Low quality, unnatural face, unnatural hands, extra fingers, missing fingers, distorted fingers, strange eye contact, asymmetrical eyes, collapsed face, distorted body, broken clothes, excessive processing, excessive skin correction, excessive exposure, unnatural texture specific to AI, illegible characters, garbled characters, logos, watermarks
